#: patterns/faq-clinical.php:29
msgid "Do you accept my PPO dental insurance, and will you verify my coverage ahead of time?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-clinical.php:30
msgid "Yes. We work with nearly all major employer and national PPO dental carriers. Share your member ID when booking and our benefits coordinator will verify your deductible, preventive coverage, and annual maximum before you arrive."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-clinical.php:35
msgid "What if I have severe dental anxiety or haven’t seen a dentist in years?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-clinical.php:36
msgid "You will never receive a lecture here. Your first appointment starts sitting upright in conversation—not reclined with instruments in your mouth. We offer topical numbing prior to any anesthetic, gentle comfort sedation options, and a simple hand-raise stop signal you control at every moment."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-clinical.php:41
msgid "How quickly can I be seen for a toothache, broken crown, or dental emergency?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-clinical.php:42
msgid "Please call (000) 000-0000 as early in the day as possible so our team can evaluate your symptoms and arrange prompt urgent dental care."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-clinical.php:47
msgid "Do you accept HSA/FSA cards and monthly payment plans?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-clinical.php:48
msgid "Yes. You can use eligible HSA or FSA cards toward exams, crowns, implants, nightguards, and clear aligners, and our team can walk you through flexible monthly payment options."
msgstr ""

